        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FDB250, 2-1/2 Inch Contemporary Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-1/2\" tall contemporary floor mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Deltana, so you can trust the quality. This medium height floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. Packaged complete with all installation hardware for wood or solid flooring including a heavy duty floor anchor for solid mounting. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FDB250_size.gif?v=1704354774\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FBD250 2-1/2 Inch Contemporary Floor Door Stop Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available Smaller <a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-contemporary-floor-door-stop-deltana-fdb125\"><b>Deltana FDB125 1-1/4 Inch Contemporary Floor Door Stops</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FDB250 Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Center of Rubber Bumper: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Black Rubber Bumper: Rectangle, 3/4\" High x 1-3/16\" Wide</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FDB250.pdf?v=1704262360\"><b>Deltana  FDB250 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
