                "description": "The 2-1/2 inch tall contemporary floor mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Deltana, so you can trust the quality. This medium height floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. Packaged complete with all installation hardware including a heavy duty floor anchor for solid mounting. ",
